{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>For not like our Rock is their Rock.</b> All this was for the enemies to understand — that HaShem delivered them over, and the victory was not theirs or their gods' — for until now their gods could do nothing against our Rock, ״כִּי לֹא כְסַלְעֵנוּ סַלְעָם.״ Every צוּר in Scripture is a term for rock." "<b>And our enemies are judges.</b> And now our enemies judge us — see, our Rock sold us to them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:24.738904641Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}